grundschutz-audit
=================

This skill contains material derived from Cloudflare's "security-audit" skill:

  Source:  https://github.com/cloudflare/security-audit-skill (commit c1c8a8c)
  License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2025-2026 Cloudflare, Inc. (see LICENSE-cloudflare)

Files in technical/ are copied from that source. Changes:
  - SKILL.md was renamed to technical/SECURITY-AUDIT.md; its frontmatter was
    removed and a context note was prepended. The body is unchanged.
  - References to "SKILL.md" in HUNTING.md, RECONNAISSANCE.md and
    VALIDATION-AND-REPORTING.md now point to "SECURITY-AUDIT.md".
  - The upstream test file for the validators was not copied.
All other files in technical/ are unchanged.

The skill's own files (SKILL.md, METHOD.md, RISK-ANALYSIS.md,
CONCEPT-AND-ISSUES.md, scripts/gspp.py) are original work under this
repository's license.

